{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["YAWARA! Sore Yuke Koshinuke Kids!!","Yawara helps a group of timid grade school kids overcome their fears and compete in a judo competition. One of the kids is Hanazono's cousin, which is how she meets them. Another is a girl who seems a whole lot like Yawara.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["YAWARA！ それゆけ腰ぬけキッズ！！",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":691,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":2009,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-2008","ids":{"shikimori":2008,"mal":2008,"anilist":2008,"kodik":"movie-84678"},"kodikIds":["movie-91281","movie-84678"],"kodikRevisions":{"movie-91281":"2022-12-01T16:35:28Z","movie-84678":"2022-03-23T11:57:04Z"},"title":"Явара! Вперёд, слабаки!","originalTitle":"Yawara! Sore yuke koshinuke kizzu!","alt":"Yawara!: Go Get 'Em, Wimpy Kids!! YAWARA！ それゆけ腰ぬけキッズ！！","description":"Явара Инокума помогает группе робкие школьники преодолеть свои страхи и побороться в дзюдо. Один из детей ханадзоно Каору Ханадзоно, который, как она их встречает. Еще одна девушка, которая, кажется, очень похоже на Явара.","year":1992,"type":"MOVIE","genres":["сэйнэн","Комедия","Романтика","Спорт","спортивные единоборства"],"rating":6.41,"popularity":1223,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[691,2009],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/2008/0b8177ba5caf915a43ed2d238ebbcf37.jpeg","width":420,"height":600},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/24bfe798c791696d3d45da5aabe9382c277a8539.jpg","width":960,"height":720}},"releasedEpisodes":[1],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-2608","dubId":"2608","label":"Автоперевод","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"movie-91281","translationId":"2608","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/video/91281/8a705d266dd0605e19b6fbb812f5a0c0/720p","season":1,"ord